---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout locale="en" title="About EA Bogota" currentPage="about-us">
<section class="ae-section page-top">
<div class="container">
  <span class="ae-eyebrow">About us</span>
  <h1 class="page-title">
    A local community of study and action,
    <span class="ae-em">from 2,640 masl</span>.
  </h1>

  <div class="ae-grid-2 ae-grid-2--rl about-block">
    <div class="ae-caption side-label">I. Who we are</div>
    <div class="ae-prose">
      <p>
        EA Bogota is a community of professionals in Bogota dedicated to using evidence and rigorous reasoning to find the best ways to help others. We want every member of our community to feel empowered to do the most good possible with their time, talent, and resources.
      </p>
      <p>
        We combine the rigor of evidence with compassion for all beings capable of suffering. We don't have definitive answers; we have a way of seeking them together.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="ae-rule" style="margin: 64px 0;" />

  <div class="ae-grid-2 ae-grid-2--rl about-block">
    <div class="ae-caption side-label">II. Our method</div>
    <div class="ae-prose">
      <p>
        We start with questions, not conclusions. We read primary research, listen to serious critiques, and revise our beliefs when the evidence warrants it.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/en/about-ea/" class="ae-link">Read the group manual &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="ae-rule" style="margin: 64px 0;" />

  <div class="ae-grid-2 ae-grid-2--rl about-block">
    <div class="ae-caption side-label">III. What we do</div>
    <div class="ae-prose">
      <p><strong>Educational events.</strong> We organize talks, workshops, and reading groups on EA topics, impactful careers, effective giving, and priority cause areas.</p>
      <p><strong>1-on-1 mentoring.</strong> We offer free individual conversations for guidance on high-impact careers, effective giving, or a personalized introduction to EA.</p>
      <p><strong>Impact evaluation.</strong> Our team includes professionals in impact evaluation and monitoring (IPA, Actra) who offer training and consulting to social organizations.</p>
      <p><strong>Community building.</strong> We connect professionals interested in doing good effectively. We facilitate social meetups, networking, and collaborations with universities and organizations in Bogota.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="ae-rule" style="margin: 64px 0;" />

  <div class="ae-grid-2 ae-grid-2--rl about-block">
    <div class="ae-caption side-label">IV. Our story</div>
    <div class="ae-prose">
      <p>EA Bogota was born from a group of professionals, many alumni of Universidad de los Andes, who discovered Effective Altruism and wanted to create a space to explore these ideas in Colombia.</p>
      <p>Today we are a growing community with active members who work in social impact organizations, research, economics, and public policy. Our approach is professional: we seek to get more experienced and skilled people to direct their talent toward the world's most important problems.</p>
      <p>We are exploring strategic partnerships with institutions like Uniandinos to amplify our reach and integrate effectiveness thinking into existing social impact programs in Colombia.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Stats -->
<section style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ae-rule-strong); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ae-rule-strong);">
<div class="container">
  <div class="ae-stats">
    <div class="ae-stat">
      <div class="ae-stat__num">2025</div>
      <div class="ae-stat__label">Year founded</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ae-stat">
      <div class="ae-stat__num">10+</div>
      <div class="ae-stat__label">Active members</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ae-stat">
      <div class="ae-stat__num">6+</div>
      <div class="ae-stat__label">Cause areas</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ae-stat">
      <div class="ae-stat__num">Bogota</div>
      <div class="ae-stat__label">Colombia</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="ae-section">
<div class="container" style="text-align: center; max-width: 640px;">
  <h2 class="section-title-ed" style="text-align: center;">
    Want to <span class="ae-em">be part of it</span>?
  </h2>
  <p style="color: var(--ae-ink-soft); margin-bottom: 32px;">
    We are always looking for curious and committed people who want to do the most good. Your background doesn't matter: what matters is your willingness to learn and act.
  </p>
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
    <a href="/en/get-involved/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Join Us</a>
    <a href="/en/get-involved/#one-on-one" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Book a 1-on-1</a>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .container { padding: 0 64px; } }
  .page-top { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height, 76px) + 48px); }
  .page-title {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--ae-t-h1); font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: var(--ae-h-tracking);
    max-width: 900px; text-wrap: balance; margin: 0 0 64px;
  }
  .section-title-ed {
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--ae-t-h1); font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: var(--ae-h-tracking);
    max-width: 900px; text-wrap: balance; margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .about-block { align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .side-label { position: sticky; top: 96px; } }
</style>
